  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Demonstrating the Freya system</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VitalFluid, founded in 2014, is a company specialised in plasma technology. The technology that will be demonstrated is the Freya system, which is capable of treating water with a plasma and producing plasma activated water (PAW) with a constant quality.This PAW is enriched with reactive oxygen species (ROS) and nitrogen species (RNS), essentially nitrate (NO3), which is readily absorbed by plants. PAW is a natural nitrogen (N)-fertiliser, whose contents can be customised to deliver the exact amount of N that each specific crop can absorb. In this way no N is lost into the environment.</narrative>
  </description>
